{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech is a top-down survival game where you'll do a lot more than crush other mechs - You trade, hack, dig, plant, loot, upgrade, free prisoners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.poster.avif?t=1772315698\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.webm?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.mp4?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech takes place in a wasteland where earthquakes and volcanic eruptions are a daily occurrence. You control Tasha, a renegade with a heart of gold (or rather silver). She is trapped in this area surrounded by deadly artifacts, together with ruthless militias and a bunch of mad punks with bad teeth and rocket launchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/97a3a22fd1a749cedd2499af1fe252d7.poster.avif?t=1772315698\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/97a3a22fd1a749cedd2499af1fe252d7.webm?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/97a3a22fd1a749cedd2499af1fe252d7.mp4?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting isn't everything\u2014if you want to survive, you'll have to somehow grow something in this dead world. But you can't do it alone. So set up a cozy base, find allies and watch them harvest your crops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.poster.avif?t=1772315698\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.webm?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.mp4?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a nice side effect, they will help you maintain your mech and produce ammunition. If you find some raw materials. And machinery. And fuel to operate them. There is a lot to do.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting new items for your mech is a big part of the game - hack bunkers, dig in the ash or just shoot it off enemy mechs! Upgrade and repair your weapons, install a magnetic shield, a jumpjet, or a boost to crush enemy vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.poster.avif?t=1772315698\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.webm?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.mp4?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infiltrate</h2>A frontal attack is not always the best option - Cut energy supplies, sabotage air support or hack a defensive turret. Develop a strategy, break free from the oppression and find your lost family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.poster.avif?t=1772315698\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.webm?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.mp4?t=1772315698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2482110?t=1772315698","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/c9cedcdb4f2a4d75dff4d5327040d32802fb9a37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772315698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/f98eed50b6c025d4e6ac6c9fb29e3eb43a7d2e10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772315698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/f98eed50b6c025d4e6ac6c9fb29e3eb43a7d2e10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772315698","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2772500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech is a top-down survival game where you'll do a lot more than crush other mechs - You trade, hack, dig, plant, loot, upgrade, free prisoners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http